# Force LF line endings in the repository AND on checkout, on every platform. Without
# this, a Windows dev machine with core.autocrlf=true checks files out with CRLF while
# Linux CI checks out the LF blob unchanged — same file, different bytes, different
# hash. Evaluation experiments identify their dataset by the SHA-256 of the file's raw
# bytes (src/evaluation/dataset.py), so a CRLF checkout would make the same dataset look
# different on Windows and in CI. (This once silently broke the old frozen baselines.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
